    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been hired to take care of a baby for one week. Sounds easy, right? <br>But something in this house is\u2026 wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, everything seems normal. At night, you must monitor the cameras, keep the baby calm\u2026 and survive the dog. <br>He doesn\u2019t like you. He protects the baby. And he\u2019s not an ordinary dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden beneath the animal\u2019s skin is something far darker \u2014 a presence that shouldn\u2019t exist. <br>Strange noises, sudden appearances, and growing tension with each passing night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new day brings a new rule, a new challenge. One step closer to the truth behind what\u2019s really happening. <br>You are Claire Scott, a newly hired nanny looking after a baby in a remote house for a week. But as the nights go by, you realize you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-time horror classics, this game blends FNaF-style camera surveillance with tense household tasks and controlled exploration moments. <br>Gameplay unfolds in real time, always in first-person, alternating between the living room \u2014 where the baby stays \u2014 and the security cameras scattered around the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house\u2019s \u201cdog\u201d seems normal during the day, but at night it becomes unpredictable, noise-sensitive, and dangerously protective of the baby. It can appear behind you at any moment. <br>Each night introduces a new mechanic or challenge, forcing you to adapt, soothe the baby, and avoid being noticed by the monster. Stay quiet, listen closely, and never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Stay silent. Look behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7c <strong>Care for the Baby</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep them fed and calm,\u00a0 too much crying might attract unwanted attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/61783ca22aa326e61f84e55788f78c5a.poster.avif?t=1750169220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/61783ca22aa326e61f84e55788f78c5a.webm?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/61783ca22aa326e61f84e55788f78c5a.mp4?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Manage the Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the fuse box. If the power goes out, the cameras go dark \u2014 and something starts to move freely in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/079c210582348f4d7dbcf171a5674cf8.poster.avif?t=1750169220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/079c210582348f4d7dbcf171a5674cf8.webm?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/079c210582348f4d7dbcf171a5674cf8.mp4?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Watch the security cameras</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cameras to keep an eye on every room. Something moves when you're not looking...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/5d418332bc5bda43b17a33a1087922f2.poster.avif?t=1750169220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/5d418332bc5bda43b17a33a1087922f2.webm?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/5d418332bc5bda43b17a33a1087922f2.mp4?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been hired to take care of a baby for one week. Sounds easy, right? <br>But something in this house is\u2026 wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, everything seems normal. At night, you must monitor the cameras, keep the baby calm\u2026 and survive the dog. <br>He doesn\u2019t like you. He protects the baby. And he\u2019s not an ordinary dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden beneath the animal\u2019s skin is something far darker \u2014 a presence that shouldn\u2019t exist. <br>Strange noises, sudden appearances, and growing tension with each passing night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new day brings a new rule, a new challenge. One step closer to the truth behind what\u2019s really happening. <br>You are Claire Scott, a newly hired nanny looking after a baby in a remote house for a week. But as the nights go by, you realize you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-time horror classics, this game blends FNaF-style camera surveillance with tense household tasks and controlled exploration moments. <br>Gameplay unfolds in real time, always in first-person, alternating between the living room \u2014 where the baby stays \u2014 and the security cameras scattered around the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house\u2019s \u201cdog\u201d seems normal during the day, but at night it becomes unpredictable, noise-sensitive, and dangerously protective of the baby. It can appear behind you at any moment. <br>Each night introduces a new mechanic or challenge, forcing you to adapt, soothe the baby, and avoid being noticed by the monster. Stay quiet, listen closely, and never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Stay silent. Look behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7c <strong>Care for the Baby</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep them fed and calm,\u00a0 too much crying might attract unwanted attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/61783ca22aa326e61f84e55788f78c5a.poster.avif?t=1750169220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/61783ca22aa326e61f84e55788f78c5a.webm?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/61783ca22aa326e61f84e55788f78c5a.mp4?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Manage the Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the fuse box. If the power goes out, the cameras go dark \u2014 and something starts to move freely in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/079c210582348f4d7dbcf171a5674cf8.poster.avif?t=1750169220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/079c210582348f4d7dbcf171a5674cf8.webm?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/079c210582348f4d7dbcf171a5674cf8.mp4?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Watch the security cameras</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cameras to keep an eye on every room. Something moves when you're not looking...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/5d418332bc5bda43b17a33a1087922f2.poster.avif?t=1750169220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/5d418332bc5bda43b17a33a1087922f2.webm?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779190/extras/5d418332bc5bda43b17a33a1087922f2.mp4?t=1750169220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
